WEBVTT

00:02:59.236 --> 00:03:01.676
na huu ulikuwa wakati wa kujifunza kuhusu unajimu.

00:03:01.676 --> 00:03:03.850
Kulikuwa na roketi zinakwenda juu angani,

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:06.546
zinakwenda huko.

00:03:06.546 --> 00:03:08.875
Hamna mnajimu ambaye alirudi

00:03:08.875 --> 00:03:12.107
na akasema kwamba amekutana na babu yangu

00:03:12.107 --> 00:03:14.566
au mtu yoyote aliyekufa.

00:03:14.566 --> 00:03:15.869
Lakini nilikuwa naogopa,

00:03:15.869 --> 00:03:18.309
wazo la kupanda lifti ya kifo

00:03:18.309 --> 00:03:19.915
kumuona babu yangu

00:03:19.915 --> 00:03:21.330
naona ni bora zaidi kuliko kwenda kumezwa

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:24.401
wakati nimelala.

00:03:24.401 --> 00:03:26.670
na nikaamini,

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:29.341
pamoja haikuleta maana sana.

00:03:29.341 --> 00:03:31.583
Na hili wazo nililokuwa nalo